/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 148 0 R
/T (   From the palace balcony, Dayang Hiraya, Princess of Marilag, watched fishermen return with nearly empty balangays. Farmers carried away ruined crops, while mothers waited for rice that was becoming harder to find. Yet inside the palace, servants and uripons prepared a grand feast for the coming Pista ng Pag-ani.)
/E (   From the palace balcony, Dayang Hiraya, Princess of Marilag, watched fishermen return with nearly empty balangays. Farmers carried away ruined crops, while mothers waited for rice that was becoming harder to find. Yet inside the palace, servants and uripons prepared a grand feast for the coming Pista ng Pag-ani.)
